AuthMySQLHost localhost
AuthMySQLUser wwwlogrotaxicom
AuthMySQLPassword cakefimu
AuthMySQLDB Autentificacion
AuthName "Acceso Restringido"
AuthType Basic
AuthMySQLUserTable wwwlogrotaxicom
AuthMySQLNameField Usuario
AuthMySQLPasswordField Password
AuthMySQLGroupField Grupo
AuthMySQLAuthoritative On
AuthMySQLScrambledPasswords On
AuthMySQLNoPasswd Off
<Limit GET POST PUT>
order deny,allow
allow from all
require user  logrotax
</Limit>
